Package: shinyOAuthDB
Title: Bridge Shiny User Authorizations to Database and Data Platform Clients
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Luka", "Koning", email = "koningluka@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Connects session-owned user authorizations, including modern
    connections from 'shinyOAuth', to existing database and data platform
    clients. Reuses native 'DBI'
    connections and public token-provider interfaces for delegated access,
    with per-session connection reuse, source-specific OAuth configuration,
    and guarded asynchronous operations through 'mirai' or 'future'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/lukakoning/shinyOAuthDB
BugReports: https://github.com/lukakoning/shinyOAuthDB/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
